{"id":"d_main_26af_02","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch26","label":"Chapter 26 · Return"},"label":"Worthy of Praise","stage":null,"prev":"d_main_26af_01","next":"d_main_26af_03","speakers":{"andersen":"Andersen"},"icons":{"andersen":"si_c903_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_26af_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_1","text":"Okay, let me make sure I'm getting all this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Office","bgArt":"office","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_fairytalesend_a","movie":null,"shown":["andersen"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_2","text":"The optical camouflage has been installed without any issues and we've successfully reclaimed a small part of the ground.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_3","text":"During that process, you met a civilian riding the Mother Whale that had somehow altered its external appearance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_4","text":"Said civilian assisted you in battle, along with Mother Whale.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_5","text":"He then gave you a map of the outside world far beyond the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_6","text":"Am I missing anything?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_7","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_7","text":"No, that's everything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_8","text":"Putting aside the obvious, which is that none of this makes any logical sense,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_9","text":"there was no way of knowing the veracity of the map,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_10","text":"so I asked Burningum to verify its credibility.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_11","text":"He got back to me with his findings an hour ago.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_12","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_12","text":"And?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_13","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_14","text":"It can be trusted. That's what I was told.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_15","text":"The Central Government has long-held intel pertaining to the outer reaches of the surface.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_16","text":"The only issue was that we couldn't confirm certain details, and thus were unable to proceed with exploration.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_17","text":"Anyway, when we compared the layout of this map to the current intel that we've collected,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_18","text":"there was a 90% match.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_19","text":"Multiple environmental scientists and terrain experts were also consulted to compare it with past data.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_20","text":"They also came to the conclusion that this map can be relied on.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_21","text":"Not only did you reclaim some of the surface, but you managed to obtain a credible map of the outside world without lifting a finger.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_22","text":"That's remarkable.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_23","text":"Just doing my job.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_24","text":"Now, moving on.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_25","text":"Starting today, the Commando Squad will focus on missions related to surface exploration.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_26","text":"First, we will dub the site you reclaimed Reclamation Site 01 and provide support both in terms of supplies and personnel.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_27","text":"We have already started construction of an elevator that will connect the Ark with Reclamation Site 01.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_28","text":"That site is to be your base of operations, from where you will explore the surface based on the information provided on this map.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_29","text":"Anything you find will be of help. Resources, alternative food sources, plant life, etc.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_30","text":"All I ask is that you keep your eyes peeled for anything and everything that will help aid the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_31","text":"I'm worried that the search area is too broad.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_32","text":"In that case, let's proceed starting from the closest area.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_33","text":"Let's see... the site in closest proximity to Reclamation Site 01 is...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_34","text":"The crystal region.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_35","text":"At the risk of sounding overly simplistic, my hope is that we'll be able to secure some minerals.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_36","text":"I'll be sending the appropriate personnel to lend you assistance in searching this area.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_37","text":"You'll also require a designated operator to support you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_38","text":"However, as you're well aware, the Ark is going through a bit of a rough patch.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_39","text":"While I may not be able to send a lot of personnel, I should be able to organize a small elite team for you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_40","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_40","text":"Understood.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_41","text":"One more thing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_42","text":"We plan on digitizing this map in the Central Government's database. Any objections?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_43","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_43","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_44","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_44","text":"Not necessarily. I do, however, want one thing to be made clear:","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_45","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_45","text":"the finding of that map, along with the forming of Reclamation Site 01, are my accomplishments.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_46","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_47","text":"Yes. Don't worry about that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_48","text":"Are you planning on visiting the reclamation site now?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_49","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_49","text":"Yes. I think it'd be best to get the ball rolling on this as soon as possible.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_50","text":"Very well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_51","text":"Upon your return to the Ark, we will have a celebration in your honor.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_52","text":"I will prepare everything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_53","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_53","text":"That really isn't necessary...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_54","text":"I don't think you quite realize the gravity of what you've accomplished.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_55","text":"This is something not a single person has been able to pull off in nearly a century.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_56","text":"It's a deed worthy of commendation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_57","text":"So soak it in.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_58","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_58","text":"Very well. Thank you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_59","text":"You should head out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_60","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_60","text":"What happened to Dorothy... the Pilgrim, I mean.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_61","text":"All quiet on that front.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_62","text":"I've agreed to give them a low-tier TV channel in the Ark, and in return, they'll be providing us with all manner of knowledge pertaining to their skills.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_63","text":"Nothing else has really transpired, to the point where it's almost too quiet.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_64","text":"It's somewhat disconcerting.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_26af_02_65","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_26af_02_65","text":"Understood.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"sho